    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 56, top: 38 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 11, color: '#6BC8D1', letterSpacing: 1.8 }}>04 / 实验与验证</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 56, top: 62, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F2F7F8', letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>边界越清楚，教学才越可信</Text>
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', right: 56, top: 76, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 10.5, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.42)' }}>BOUNDARY · SOURCES</Text>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 56, top: 150, width: 486 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9.5, color: '#6BC8D1', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>WHAT THIS IS / IS NOT</Text>
        <Text style={{ marginTop: 18, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 42, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F2F7F8', lineHeight: 1.35, letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>
            这是教学抽象，<br /><span style={{ color: '#E78172' }}>不是攻击预测。</span>
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 24, width: 42, height: 2, background: 'rgba(107,200,209,0.55)' }} />
        <Text style={{ marginTop: 20, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.54)', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>
            不模拟漏洞利用、凭据或恶意代码；<br />
            不连接真实网络，也不执行任何攻击行为；<br />
            不输出真实网络的风险概率或预测结论。
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 596, top: 142, width: 628 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', height: 78, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(242,247,248,0.10)' }}>
            <Text style={{ width: 44, marginTop: 12, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 10, color: '#6BC8D1' }}>01</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 572 }}>
                <Text style={{ marginTop: 10, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F2F7F8' }}>模式边界</Text>
                <Text style={{ marginTop: 3, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 11.5, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.54)', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>通信判定与状态转移分开；seed 是实验前已存在的状态，不计入本轮传播步骤。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', height: 78, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(242,247,248,0.10)' }}>
            <Text style={{ width: 44, marginTop: 12, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 10, color: '#6BC8D1' }}>02</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 572 }}>
                <Text style={{ marginTop: 10, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F2F7F8' }}>能力边界</Text>
                <Text style={{ marginTop: 3, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 11.5, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.54)', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>只表示权限级别与数据访问能力；DATA_ACCESS 不等于数据库主机被控制。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', height: 78, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(242,247,248,0.10)' }}>
            <Text style={{ width: 44, marginTop: 12, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 10, color: '#6BC8D1' }}>03</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 572 }}>
                <Text style={{ marginTop: 10, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F2F7F8' }}>数据边界</Text>
                <Text style={{ marginTop: 3, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 11.5, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.54)', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>纯前端应用；场景、结果与学习进度都留在本地，不上传任何实验数据。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', height: 78, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(242,247,248,0.10)', borderBottom: '1px solid rgba(242,247,248,0.10)' }}>
            <Text style={{ width: 44, marginTop: 12, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 10, color: '#E78172' }}>04</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 572 }}>
                <Text style={{ marginTop: 10, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F2F7F8' }}>结论边界</Text>
                <Text style={{ marginTop: 3, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 11.5, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.54)', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>搜索达到深度或状态上限时标注“未完整”；不把“没搜到”当作“安全”。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 56, top: 546, width: 1168, paddingTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(242,247,248,0.10)' }}>
